# システム環境設定's このページの仮身を作る (docs/tessronos 11.6): the object of the page, named
# システム環境設定：画面, made and a link to it put in the first window (lib/libtv/tv_page.c); opened
# from there, its applist opens the page. For
# tools/ui_run.py with the kernel of make TARGET=_QEMU_VIRT_ DESKTOP=1 UITEST=1 and the test disk of
# a KTEST=1 build. The window is at 160,80; its menu opens at 400,300 with 操作 under the pointer,
# このページの仮身を作る the fourth line of 操作. "openputlink" reads the link back from the
# cabinet's record as the first window saved it and opens it as a double press does.
openapp 01a0d8c4-52b6-7b52-9d72-3e8fa01b2c42 {"tessronos-sysenv":{"data":"screen"}}
expect sysenv: page "screen"
expect sysenv: ready
wait 800
click 400 300 1
wait 500
move 405 341
wait 150
move 440 341
wait 150
move 470 341
wait 300
shot spl_menu_op
move 495 392
wait 150
click 495 392
expect sysenv: link of page "screen" put (0)
expect tvpage: object "システム環境設定：画面" of page "screen" made (0)
expect desktop: link put "システム環境設定：画面" (0)
wait 1200
shot spl_put
# another page shown, then the link opened: the screen's page again, in the same window
openapp 01a0d8c4-52b6-7b52-9d72-3e8fa01b2c42 {"tessronos-sysenv":{"data":"colour"}}
expect sysenv: page "colour"
wait 500
logmark
openputlink
expectsince uitest: link put has applist of
expectsince sysenv: opened with data "screen"
expectsince sysenv: page "screen"
wait 500
nwin システム環境設定
want ok 1
absent !OACV!
